{"h": "\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Geist', system-ui, sans-serif; color: #0B2A4A; background: #FFFFFF; min-width: 0; overflow: hidden\">\n\n\n<!-- hero -->\n<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #DDF0FF 0%, #FFFFFF 100%)\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 80px 32px 40px\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; background: #FFC93C; color: #0B2A4A; border-radius: 999px; padding: 7px 14px; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; letter-spacing: 0.08em; margin-bottom: 20px\">A LICENSED BROKER REPLIES WITHIN 2 WORKING HOURS</div>\n<h1 style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%; font-size: clamp(48px, 6vw, 92px); line-height: 0.96; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 0 0 18px; max-width: 1000px\">Let's talk about <span style=\"color: #0A6CC2\">what's moving.</span></h1>\n<p style=\"font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.55; color: #17436B; max-width: 720px; margin: 0\">A quote, a customs question, a shipment that's stuck, or a partnership idea. Pick the quickest way for you.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- channels -->\n<div style=\"max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 8px 32px 0\">\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 14px\">\n<a href=\"https://wa.me/message/6YB7I76DV6UJL1\" style=\"text-decoration: none; background: #25D366; color: #06331A; border-radius: 24px; padding: 26px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px\">\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.12em;\">FASTEST</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%; font-size: 26px\">WhatsApp</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600\">@YAMLOGISTICS</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; opacity: .85\">Send a photo of the invoice or the AWB</span></a>\n<a href=\"https://t.me/YAMLOGISTICS\" style=\"text-decoration: none; background: #229ED9; color: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 24px; padding: 26px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px\">\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #E3F4FC\">دردشة فورية</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%; font-size: 26px\">Telegram</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600\">@YAMLOGISTICS</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #E3F4FC\">راسلنا من هاتفك أو حاسوبك</span></a>\n<a href=\"tel:+911141603301\" style=\"text-decoration: none; background: #0A6CC2; color: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 24px; padding: 26px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px\">\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #FFC93C\">HEAD OFFICE</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%; font-size: 26px\">Call us</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600\">+91 11 4160 3301 / 02</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #DCEEFC\">Mon–Sat, 10:00–18:00 IST</span></a>\n<a href=\"mailto:info@yamlogistics.com\" style=\"text-decoration: none; background: #F2F8FD; color: #0B2A4A; border-radius: 24px; padding: 26px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px\">\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #0A6CC2\">FOR DOCUMENTS</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%; font-size: 26px\">Email</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600\">info@yamlogistics.com</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #5E7891\">Best for invoices, packing lists and drawings</span></a>\n<a href=\"https://wa.me/message/6YB7I76DV6UJL1\" style=\"text-decoration: none; background: #0B2A4A; color: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 24px; padding: 26px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px\">\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #25D366\">● OPEN NOW</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%; font-size: 26px\">Urgent air cargo</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600\">Sahar desk, 24×7</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #BFE5FF\">After midnight is normal for us</span></a>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- form + map -->\n<div style=\"max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 56px 32px 100px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 28px; align-items: flex-start\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1.4 1 600px; min-width: 0; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E1EDF7; border-radius: 28px; box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(11,42,74,0.08); padding: 34px\">\n<sc-if value=\"{{sent}}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ false }}\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center; padding: 60px 10px\">\n<div style=\"width: 72px; height: 72px; border-radius: 50%; background: #FFC93C; margin: 0 auto 20px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 34px; font-weight: 900\">✓</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%; font-size: 36px; line-height: 1.05\">Thank you, {{firstName}}.</div>\n<p style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.6; color: #3D5873; max-width: 440px; margin: 14px auto 24px\">A licensed broker will reply within 2 working hours. If it's urgent, WhatsApp us and quote your enquiry.</p>\n<button onClick=\"{{reset}}\" style=\"background: #EEF6FD; color: #0A6CC2; border: 0; border-radius: 999px; padding: 13px 22px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit\">Send another enquiry</button>\n</div>\n</sc-if>\n<sc-if value=\"{{notSent}}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ true }}\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%; font-size: 30px; margin-bottom: 6px\">Send us an enquiry</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #5E7891; margin-bottom: 22px\">What is it about?</div>\n<div role=\"radiogroup\" aria-label=\"Enquiry type\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 24px\">\n<sc-for list=\"{{types}}\" as=\"t\" hint-placeholder-count=\"6\">\n<button role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"{{t.on}}\" onClick=\"{{t.pick}}\" style=\"{{t.style}}\">{{t.label}}</button>\n</sc-for>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 14px\">\n<label style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #3D5873\">Your name *<input class=\"fld\" type=\"text\" value=\"{{name}}\" onChange=\"{{setName}}\" placeholder=\"Full name\"></label>\n<label style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #3D5873\">Company<input class=\"fld\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Company name\"></label>\n<label style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #3D5873\">Email *<input class=\"fld\" type=\"email\" value=\"{{email}}\" onChange=\"{{setEmail}}\" placeholder=\"you@company.com\"></label>\n<label style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #3D5873\">WhatsApp / phone<input class=\"fld\" type=\"tel\" placeholder=\"+91 …\"></label>\n<label style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #3D5873\">{{f1}}<input class=\"fld\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"{{f1ph}}\"></label>\n<label style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #3D5873\">{{f2}}<input class=\"fld\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"{{f2ph}}\"></label>\n</div>\n<label style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #3D5873; margin-top: 14px\">Tell us more<textarea class=\"fld\" rows=\"4\" placeholder=\"{{msgph}}\" style=\"resize: vertical\"></textarea></label>\n<label style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-top: 14px; padding: 16px; border: 1.5px dashed #C9DCEC; border-radius: 14px; font-size: 15px; color: #3D5873; cursor: pointer\">📎 <span><strong style=\"color: #0A6CC2\">Attach a file</strong>: invoice, packing list, AWB or drawings (optional)</span><input type=\"file\" style=\"display: none\"></label>\n<sc-if value=\"{{hasError}}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ false }}\"><div style=\"margin-top: 14px; color: #B42318; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600\">{{error}}</div></sc-if>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px; align-items: center; margin-top: 22px\">\n<button class=\"go\" onClick=\"{{submit}}\" type=\"button\" style=\"background: #0A6CC2; color: #FFFFFF; border: 0; border-radius: 999px; padding: 0 32px; min-height: 56px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit\">Send enquiry →</button>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #5E7891\">We reply within 2 working hours. We never share your details.</span>\n</div>\n</sc-if>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 400px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px\">\n<div style=\"border-radius: 28px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px #DCEAF6\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 520 600\" width=\"100%\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"YAM offices in New Delhi, Mumbai and Mundra, and customs stations across India\" style=\"display:block\"><defs><pattern id=\"cgrid\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"7\" r=\"1.2\" fill=\"#C9E2F7\" /></pattern></defs><rect width=\"520\" height=\"600\" rx=\"28\" fill=\"#F2F8FD\" /><rect width=\"520\" height=\"600\" rx=\"28\" fill=\"url(#cgrid)\" /><line x1=\"284.5\" y1=\"85.6\" x2=\"175.3\" y2=\"219.1\" stroke=\"#9CC9EE\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 5\" /><line x1=\"284.5\" y1=\"85.6\" x2=\"372.3\" y2=\"130.8\" stroke=\"#9CC9EE\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 5\" /><line x1=\"284.5\" y1=\"85.6\" x2=\"296.6\" y2=\"444.9\" stroke=\"#9CC9EE\" stroke-width=\"1.