 · Head Office</text><circle cx=\"174.8\" cy=\"319.3\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#FFC93C\" opacity=\".4\"><animate attributeName=\"r\" values=\"10;20;10\" dur=\"2.6s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" /></circle><circle cx=\"174.8\" cy=\"319.3\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#FFC93C\" stroke=\"#0B2A4A\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" /><text x=\"160.8\" y=\"337.3\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"Archivo, sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#0B2A4A\" stroke=\"#F2F8FD\" stroke-width=\"4\" paint-order=\"stroke\">Mumbai · Sea</text><circle cx=\"181.2\" cy=\"295.5\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#FFC93C\" opacity=\".4\"><animate attributeName=\"r\" values=\"10;20;10\" dur=\"2.6s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" /></circle><circle cx=\"181.2\" cy=\"295.5\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#FFC93C\" stroke=\"#0B2A4A\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" /><text x=\"167.2\" y=\"289.5\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"Archivo, sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#0B2A4A\" stroke=\"#F2F8FD\" stroke-width=\"4\" paint-order=\"stroke\">Mumbai · Air, 24×7</text><circle cx=\"105.7\" cy=\"226.6\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#FFC93C\" opacity=\".4\"><animate attributeName=\"r\" values=\"10;20;10\" dur=\"2.6s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" /></circle><circle cx=\"105.7\" cy=\"226.6\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#FFC93C\" stroke=\"#0B2A4A\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" /><text x=\"101.7\" y=\"208.6\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Archivo, sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#0B2A4A\" stroke=\"#F2F8FD\" stroke-width=\"4\" paint-order=\"stroke\">Mundra</text><g font-family=\"Geist, sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#0B2A4A\"><circle cx=\"34\" cy=\"550\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#FFC93C\" stroke=\"#0B2A4A\" stroke-width=\"2\" /><text x=\"50\" y=\"555\">YAM office</text><circle cx=\"34\" cy=\"574\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#0A6CC2\" /><text x=\"50\" y=\"579\">Customs station we clear at</text></g></svg></div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #5E7891; padding: 0 6px\">Schematic, not to scale.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- offices -->\n<div style=\"background: #FFF8E6\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 96px 32px\">\n<h2 style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%; font-size: clamp(38px, 4.4vw, 60px); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 0 0 36px\">Our offices. The coffee is on us.</h2>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 14px\">\n<sc-for list=\"{{offices}}\" as=\"f\" hint-placeholder-count=\"4\">\n<div style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 22px; padding: 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px\">\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #0A6CC2\">{{f.city}}</span>\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-stretch: 106%; font-size: 20px\">{{f.role}}</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: #3D5873; white-space: pre-line\">{{f.addr}}</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #0B2A4A; font-weight: 600\">{{f.hours}}</span>\n<a href=\"{{f.map}}\" style=\"font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; margin-top: 4px\">Open in Google Maps →</a>\n</div>\n</sc-for>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- FAQ -->\n<div style=\"max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 96px 32px\">\n<h2 style=\"font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 110%; font-size: clamp(36px, 4.2vw, 56px); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 0 0 32px\">Before you get in touch</h2>\n<sc-for list=\"{{faqs}}\" as=\"q\" hint-placeholder-count=\"4\">\n<details style=\"background: #F2F8FD; border-radius: 16px; padding: 20px 24px; margin-bottom: 10px\">\n<summary style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 18px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px\">{{q.q}}<span style=\"color: #0A6CC2\">+</span></summary>\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; color: #3D5873; margin: 12px 0 0\">{{q.a}}</p>\n</details>\n</sc-for>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n"}